                                    <div class="card-body flex-fill p-4">
                                        <div class="row justify-space-between align-items-center">
                                            <div class="col">
                                                <h5 class="mb-0"><span data-sheets-root="1" data-sheets-value="{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;What are the benefits of Sonatype Nexus Repository Manager vs. JFrog Artifactory?\n&quot;}" data-sheets-userformat="{&quot;2&quot;:4993,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;10&quot;:0,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;15&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;}">What are the benefits of Sonatype Nexus Repository Manager vs. JFrog Artifactory?<br></span></h5>
                                                <p class="mb-0"></p>
