                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                      <div class="row justify-space-between align-items-center module--expanded-content">
                                        <div class="col pt-2">
                                          <p><span data-sheets-root="1" data-sheets-value="{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Customers choose Nexus Repository as the smart repository option because of strong integration with popular build tools, like Maven. Nexus Repository is also known for its integration capabilities, ease of use and support options. &quot;}" data-sheets-userformat="{&quot;2&quot;:4993,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;10&quot;:0,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;15&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;}">Customers choose Nexus Repository as the smart repository option because of strong integration with popular build tools, like Maven. Nexus Repository is also known for its integration capabilities, ease of use and support options. </span></p>
                                        </div>
                                      </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                     
                           <div class="col-12 mx-auto">
                                <div class="expander--card mb-3 bg-white">
                                    
                                    <div class="card-body flex-fill p-4">
                                        <div class="row justify-space-between align-items-center">
                                            <div class="col">
                                                <h5 class="mb-0"><span data-sheets-root="1" data-sheets-value="{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;What are the benefits of Sonatype Lifecycle  vs. JFrog Advanced Security?\n&quot;}" data-sheets-userformat="{&quot;2&quot;:4993,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;10&quot;:0,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;15&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;}">What are the benefits of Sonatype Lifecycle vs. JFrog Advanced Security?<br></span></h5>
